[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13143.349, "timestamp": "03:39:03", "text": "类似Arc的东西叫Dia"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13145.269, "timestamp": "03:39:05", "text": "像 Edge"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13146.95, "timestamp": "03:39:06", "text": "迪亚？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13148.71, "timestamp": "03:39:08", "text": "所以你可以聊天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.83, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "你的浏览器实际上就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13154.469, "timestamp": "03:39:14", "text": "假设你想起草一封电子邮件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13156.79, "timestamp": "03:39:16", "text": "关于你的学校项目之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13159.429, "timestamp": "03:39:19", "text": "现在你的东西都准备好了，比如说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13161.349, "timestamp": "03:39:21", "text": "我得做些调查之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13163.429, "timestamp": "03:39:23", "text": "写封邮件，以便保留你的研究成果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13165.67, "timestamp": "03:39:25", "text": "材料 PDF 文件以及所有内容均已打开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13170.15, "timestamp": "03:39:30", "text": "标签页，然后你打开那个呃……提示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13173.269, "timestamp": "03:39:33", "text": "呃，人工智能提示，比如输入指令"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13177.269, "timestamp": "03:39:37", "text": "对，告诉他们提到每个标签页。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13179.91, "timestamp": "03:39:39", "text": "或者你可以选择所有标签页，然后像这样："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.83, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "“是的，就此和此起草一份信息。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13183.59, "timestamp": "03:39:43", "text": "就这样。”它会自动执行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13187.99, "timestamp": "03:39:47", "text": "它。那很酷吗？保存信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13190.55, "timestamp": "03:39:50", "text": "是的。 GeForce 也做了类似的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13194.07, "timestamp": "03:39:54", "text": "同一件事。我猜他们当时正在制作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13196.72, "timestamp": "03:39:56", "text": "是的，他们当时正在制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13198.79, "timestamp": "03:39:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]